  Description: Prerequisite Region - High Seas You're fascinated by the lost Azlanti
    Empire and have dedicated yourself to seeking out and studying every broken artifact
    or scrap of knowledge that remains, whether as an academic pursuit or simply
    for the joy of treasure hunting. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Arcana skill and the Azlant Lore skills. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick
    Identification] skill feat.
